      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A temperature- and strain-rate-induced transition in plasticity mechanism accounts for the Co-free alloy's favorable dynamic strength–ductility balance.",
